abstract: "One-click OpenStreetMap into native QGIS: function-styled vector layers plus flat-roof 3D building massing on a selectable study-area shape (rectangle, rounded rectangle, circle, hexagon or your own selected polygon), with selectable map themes, an optional recessed base and a basemap underlay."
